<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2013/05/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>TokenVector.Data</id>
    <version>1.0.8-dev</version>
    <title>TokenVector.Data - High-Performance Columnar DataFrame &amp; Tabular Engine (TokenVector Language)</title>
    <authors>TokenVector Project Team</authors>
    <license type="expression">MIT</license>
    <licenseUrl>https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT</licenseUrl>
    <readme>README.md</readme>
    <releaseNotes>1.0.8-dev: SQL/Excel/Parquet-ledger (tvsrc v2.1). tokenvector_sql: SELECT engine on DataFrame - sql_query/sql_query2/sql_count (WHERE/GROUP BY/HAVING/ORDER BY/LIMIT/OFFSET/DISTINCT, INNER/LEFT/RIGHT JOIN, IN/LIKE, 10 aggregates, verified number-for-number vs pandas). tokenvector_excel: SpreadsheetML 2003 read/write (pure XML, Excel opens directly). tokenvector_parquet: honest ledger - API reserved but fail-fast (real Parquet needs compiler binary write + bitwise R5). sql_check 37/37, excel_check 33/33, 20/20 suites green on DIST tkvc, DLL smoke 54/54 symbols + functional C# calls.</releaseNotes>
    <description>High-performance columnar DataFrame and tabular data processing library, natively implemented in the TokenVector language (tkv) and compiled to a .NET CIL DLL: schema, columns, series, vector math, filter, group-by, joins (incl. AsOf), pivot/melt, CSV/JSON IO, Arrow IPC stream and out-of-core batches, SQL SELECT engine, SpreadsheetML Excel IO, zero-copy Mat bridge for numerics.</description>
    <tags>dataframe columnar arrow feather csv json timeseries asofjoin tokenvector data</tags>
    <dependencies>
      <group targetFramework="net8.0" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
</package>
